        <scopecontent id="aspace_f630e808718443a8af130c3de2d53ba6">
          <head>Scope and Contents</head>
          <p>These files contain materials relating to solid waste and incineration issues, such as recycling and dioxin production. The series also contains the small amount of administrative materials for the group Concerned Citizens for the Environment (CCE) to be found in this collection. It also contains materials relating to the proposed Inter-Power power generation facility that inspired Ken Dufty to form CCE in opposition.</p>
        </scopecontent>
